# ACOD demo: two contrasting pairs for the manual route-comparison tool
# (shift-click two aircraft in AirTrafficRadar to arm/disarm it), plus one
# uninvolved background flight.
#
# Pair 1 - KLM1074 & TRA53J: both routed via ARTIP then EHAM, same FL200.
#          Their remaining routes actually meet at ARTIP, so once armed,
#          ACOD's closest-approach marker collapses to a single point there
#          (0 NM). ASAS/RESO are on, so this pair also trips automatic STCA
#          (amber, blinking) shortly before ARTIP - compare that against the
#          manually-armed ACOD pink lines on the same two aircraft.
#
# Pair 2 - EZY81H & WZZ22P: parallel tracks, 12 NM apart, FL280 vs FL310.
#          Their routes never meet, so ACOD draws a dashed connector with a
#          real, constant ~12 NM length instead of collapsing to a point -
#          even though the two are already vertically separated too.
#
# IBE31M is unrelated background traffic - ACOD stays empty for it since the
# display only ever shows the pair you've actually shift-clicked.
#
# Only one pair can be armed at a time: to switch pairs, shift-click one
# current member again first (this disarms and frees the slot) before
# shift-clicking a new aircraft.

00:00:00.00>ASAS ON
00:00:00.00>RESO OFF
00:00:00.00>PAN 52.1,4.7

# --- Pair 1: converge on ARTIP, FL200 ---

# KLM1074 EDDF-EHAM, inbound to ARTIP from the east
00:00:00.00>CRE KLM1074,B738,52.3842,6.6989,280,FL200,285
00:00:00.00>ORIG KLM1074,EDDF
00:00:00.00>ADDWPT KLM1074,ARTIP
00:00:00.00>DEST KLM1074,EHAM
00:00:00.00>DIRECT KLM1074,ARTIP
00:00:00.00>LNAV KLM1074,ON
00:00:00.00>VNAV KLM1074,ON

# TRA53J LFPG-EHAM, inbound to ARTIP from the south
00:00:00.00>CRE TRA53J,A320,51.8526,5.1814,020,FL200,280
00:00:00.00>ORIG TRA53J,LFPG
00:00:00.00>ADDWPT TRA53J,ARTIP
00:00:00.00>DEST TRA53J,EHAM
00:00:00.00>DIRECT TRA53J,ARTIP
00:00:00.00>LNAV TRA53J,ON
00:00:00.00>VNAV TRA53J,ON

# --- Pair 2: parallel, non-crossing, 12 NM apart ---

# EZY81H EGLL-EDDB, northern track, FL280
00:00:00.00>CRE EZY81H,A320,52.2000,3.0000,090,FL280,280
00:00:00.00>ORIG EZY81H,EGLL
00:00:00.00>ADDWPT EZY81H,52.2000,4.2000,FL280
00:00:00.00>DEST EZY81H,EDDB
00:00:00.00>DIRECT EZY81H,EZY81H001
00:00:00.00>LNAV EZY81H,ON
00:00:00.00>VNAV EZY81H,ON

# WZZ22P EGKK-EDDK, southern track, FL310 - stays 12 NM south of EZY81H
00:00:00.00>CRE WZZ22P,A321,52.0000,3.0000,090,FL310,280
00:00:00.00>ORIG WZZ22P,EGKK
00:00:00.00>ADDWPT WZZ22P,52.0000,4.2000,FL310
00:00:00.00>DEST WZZ22P,EDDK
00:00:00.00>DIRECT WZZ22P,WZZ22P001
00:00:00.00>LNAV WZZ22P,ON
00:00:00.00>VNAV WZZ22P,ON

# --- Background traffic (uninvolved) ---

# IBE31M EHRD-LEMG
00:00:00.00>CRE IBE31M,E190,51.6151,4.5272,206,FL230,275
00:00:00.00>ORIG IBE31M,EHRD
00:00:00.00>ADDWPT IBE31M,KUDAD
00:00:00.00>ADDWPT IBE31M,WOODY
00:00:00.00>DEST IBE31M,LEMG
00:00:00.00>DIRECT IBE31M,WOODY
00:00:00.00>LNAV IBE31M,ON
00:00:00.00>VNAV IBE31M,ON